    "media:imagetext": "HERE'S HOW TO PUT THE LOW FARES TOGETHER\nExample - Short Limits\nAAL - LAX/DAL/LAX (Regular R. T.)\nDAL - DAL/MSY/DAL (CAB 15)\nLocal Passenger Tariff No. Ex 4\nSpecial DC-6 Super charges\nNAL - MSY/TPA/HAV/TPA/MSY\nMSY/TPA/HAV/MIA/MSY\n(CAB 27)\nMSY/MIA/HAV/MIA/MSY\nMSY/MIA/HAV/TPA/MSY )\nLocal Passenger Tariff Pm. No. 2\nExample - Medium Limits\nAAL - LAX/DAL/LAX (Regular R. T.)\nDAL - DAL/MSY/DAL (CAB 15)\nLocal Passenger Tariff No. Ex 4\nSpecial DC-6 Super charges\nNAL - MSY/MIA/MSY (CAB 19)\nL. P. T. Pm. No. 4\nNAL - MIA/HAV/MIA (CAB 24)\nL. I. P. F. T. HAV. F-1\nS143.10\n21.40\n21.40\n2.20\n2.20\n$ 96.70\n$287.00\nS143.10\n21.40\n21.40\n2.20\n2.20\n37.05\n37.05\n30.00\n$294.40\nDelta's CAB 15- LPT No. EX4 - Tickets on sale until Oct. 31, 1949 - final\nreturn limit Nov. 15, 1949 - otherwise 60 DAY LIMIT.\nNATIONAL'S CAB 27-LPT Pm. No. 2 - Tickets on sale until Dec. 30, 1949 -\nfinal return limit Dec. 30, 1949 - otherwise 120 days validity -\nHOWEVER - return to MSY must be by midnight 9 DAYS AFTER DATE\nOF DEPARTURE FROM MSY.\nNATIONAL'S CAB 19 - LPT No. 4 - Tickets on sale until Oct. 31, 1949 -\nfinal return limit Oct. 31, 1949 - otherwise 60 days limit CAN\nONLY BE SOLD IN CONNECTION WITH \"ON\" TICKETS TO WEST\nINDIES, MEXICO, and SOUTH AMERICA.\nNATIONAL'S CAB 24 - LIPFT. HAV. F-1 - On sale DAILY - 30 days return\nlimit - ($36.00 1 year return limit)",
